  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Class Specific Understanding (Support Specialist, optional rule): 2 Breakthroughs, only one.</em></p><p>You have unlocked a well of healing from deep within. You have a pool of healing separate from your RCT pool containing a number of hit points equal to twice your level. You can draw any number of healing from this pool as a bonus action to heal yourself. You can use this healing on another creature you touch at 5th level.</p>"
